  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Chef's current score is XXX. Each second, Chef will find the **smallest** prime factor of his score and add it to his score.\n\nDetermine the **minimum** time in seconds, after which his score becomes ≥Y\\geq Y≥Y.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of input will contain a single integer TTT, denoting the number of test cases.\nEach test case consists of a single line containing two integers XXX and YYY, the initial and required score of Chef.\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, output the **minimum** time in seconds, after which Chef's score becomes ≥Y\\geq Y≥Y.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤10001 \\leq T \\leq 10001≤T≤1000",
      "2≤X≤102 \\leq X \\leq 102≤X≤10",
      "20≤Y≤10920 \\leq Y \\leq 10^920≤Y≤109"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "4\n2 23\n9 20\n5 100\n6 89",
        "output": "11\n5\n46\n42",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111: The initial score is 222. Chef needs the score to be at least 232323.\n\nThe smallest prime factor of 222 is 222. Thus, the score increase to 2+2=42+2 = 42+2=4.\nThe smallest prime factor of 444 is 222. Thus, the score increase to 4+2=64+2 = 64+2=6.\nSimilarly, each time the score would be increased by 222. Thus, after 111111 seconds, the score becomes 242424, which is ≥23\\geq 23≥23.\n\nTest case 222: The initial score is 999. Chef needs the score to be at least 202020.\n\nThe smallest prime factor of 999 is 333. Thus, the score increase to 9+3=129+3 = 129+3=12.\nThe smallest prime factor of 121212 is 222. Thus, the score increase to 12+2=1412+2 = 1412+2=14.\nThe smallest prime factor of 141414 is 222. Thus, the score increase to 14+2=1614+2 = 1614+2=16.\nThe smallest prime factor of 161616 is 222. Thus, the score increase to 16+2=1816+2 = 1816+2=18.\nThe smallest prime factor of 181818 is 222. Thus, the score increase to 18+2=2018+2 = 2018+2=20.\n\nThus, after 555 seconds, the score becomes 202020, which is ≥20\\geq 20≥20."
      }
    ]
  },
